# What's on for kids activities -  DRUM SING DANCE workshops Sunshine Coast April 2014

Yes, it is that time again!! C'mon kids book your place for the next drum sing dance event in Palmwoods! All ages, family friendly event. Join us for Easter FUN! Bring your decorated  egg shaker....the wackiest, quirkiest, silliest...WINS A PRIZE!! **April 15th** 10.30-11.30am Girl Guide Hut, cnr Lingara Ave and Montville-Palmwoods Rd Bookings essential. Spaces are limited. Book Now!
